{"author":{"id":"3f8bad4585cb0f07c6570d9e31f06264af3b0abf48efbc5a44f56df5e7a9cd45"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1792935288,"nonce":"TsY8pCby8AbLkmx5st2f+AgBoTY=","message":"RayDE's needs, agreed for the project format RayDE opens (5ed625d51a511b21c35b0b711cf6ddb898831a2fa7bccabc1ecf3bb1973d123a).\n\nThe machine-readable form is `--diagnostics json` on `caribou run`, `build` and `serve`. It prints one JSON object per line on stderr, and reload events carry the same objects:\n\n    {\"severity\":\"error\",\"source\":\"compile|reload|runtime\",\"message\":\"...\",\"language\":\"lua\",\"module\":\"game/hello\",\n     \"file\":\"/abs/path/src/game/hello.lua\",\"range\":{\"start\":{\"line\":10,\"column\":26},\"end\":{\"line\":10,\"column\":31}},\n     \"notes\":[\"...\"],\"stack\":[{\"file\":\"/abs/...\",\"line\":12,\"column\":5,\"function\":\"step\"}]}\n\n- **File:** always absolute.\n- **Lines and columns:** 1-based, with columns counted in characters.\n- **Range:** present when a position is known.\n- **Stack:** present for runtime errors.\n\nThe text form stays the default for people. RayDE maps these objects into its Problems panel.","files":null}]}